    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 4000
  },
  {
    "id": 2011010110120,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "──毎日、昨日よりちょっとでも\r\n進めるようにって頑張って……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101011/2011010110120"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00308",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 4000
  },
  {
    "id": 2011010110130,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "それで、いつの間にか、\r\n色んなことが変わっていって……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101011/2011010110130"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00309",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 4000
  },
  {
    "id": 2011010110140,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……できるようになったことも\r\nもうできなくなったこともあるんだよな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101011/2011010110140"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00127",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 4000
  },
  {
    "id": 2011010110150,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "そういうことに気付く度に、アタシの頑張り方は\r\n間違ってないのかなとか、思っちまうんだ",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/201101011/2011010110150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011010110160,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "本当はちゃんといつも、前を向いてたいんだけどな……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101011/2011010110160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "樹里……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "id": 2011010110170,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……とか言いながら\r\n過去は変えられないし、未来はわからなくて",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101011/2011010110170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011010110180,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "なんか、改めてアタシたちには\r\n今しかないんだよなーって……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101011/2011010110180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……はは\r\nそれはなんか、寂しく聞こえるなぁ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011010110190,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "──あぁ、いや\r\nそういうつもりじゃなくて……",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101011/2011010110190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……うん\r\nだって、そんな今が未来に繋がってるんだもんな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011010110200,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……！\r\n…………ああ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101011/2011010110200"
  },
  {
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "id": 2011010110210,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "──つーか、悪い！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101011/2011010110210"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011010110220,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "ただでさえあっついのに、\r\nなんか暑苦しい話しちゃってさ",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101011/2011010110220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……いや",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "たまには立ち止まったり、振り返ったりしていいと思うぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だってそれは、樹里がこれからも\r\n前を向いて進むためなんだからさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011010110230,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "…………",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101011/2011010110230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……それに",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "できなくなったこと、あるかもしれないけど……\r\n仕事帰りのパキッくらいならいつでも付き合うからな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
